      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SINKRATE (5) disappointed backers last time out when sixth, beaten 9 metres, over 1780m at this track. Form prior to that was strong, including a very close fourth over 1660m at Albion Park two starts ago. Meets a comparable field and he can figure in the finish. THATS CLASSIC (7) did a good job to finish in the minor placings two runs back then things went sour last time when he broke following interference and finished a long way back in eighth over 1660m at Albion Park. Can travel in a nice spot from this draw and wait on the sprint lane if necessary. Beautifully placed and he should turn things around. PERFECT LOU (8) is on the radar after his last-start fourth over 1780m here a week ago. Include in calculations. JUSTANOTHER TORQUE (6) showed pleasing improvement last time out when third over 2040m at this circuit. Can trouble the judge with any luck in running.",
